### 재고 10개인 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Test T-Shirt",
  "gender": "MEN",
  "category": "TOP",
  "color": "WHITE",
  "price": 30000,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test.jpg",
  "size": "L",
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### 업데이트

PUT http://localhost:8080/products/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Updated T-Shirt",
  "gender": "MEN",
  "category": "TOP",
  "color": "BLACK",
  "price": 35000,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test.jpg",
  "size": "M",
  "stockQuantity": 15
}

### 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/7

### 잘못된 가격 입력
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Validation Test",
  "gender": "MEN",
  "category": "TOP",
  "color": "WHITE",
  "price": -30000,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test.jpg",
  "size": "L",
  "stockQuantity": 0
}

### 잘못된 상품명 입력
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "",
  "gender": "MEN",
  "category": "TOP",
  "color": "WHITE",
  "price": 30000,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test.jpg",
  "size": "L",
  "stockQuantity": 0
}

### 남성 상품
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=MEN

### 남성 상의
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=MEN&category=TOP

### 검정색 상품
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?color=BLACK

### 여성 하의
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=WOMEN&category=BOTTOM

### 남성 검정색 상의
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=MEN&category=TOP&color=BLACK

### 공용 상품
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=UNISEX

### 전체 상품
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter

### 가격 낮은 순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/sort?sort=priceAsc

### 가격 높은 순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/sort?sort=priceDesc

### 최신 등록순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/sort?sort=latest

### 잘못된 정렬 조건
GET http://localhost:8080/products/sort?sort=abc

### 첫 번째 페이지 (10개)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=10

### 두 번째 페이지 (10개)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=1&size=10

### 첫 번째 페이지 (5개)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=5

### 잘못된 페이지 번호
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=-1&size=10

### 너무 큰 페이지 크기
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=101

### 첫 번째 페이지 - 최신순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=10&sort=latest

### 첫 번째 페이지 - 가격 낮은 순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=10&sort=priceAsc

### 첫 번째 페이지 - 가격 높은 순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=10&sort=priceDesc

### 두 번째 페이지 - 가격 낮은 순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=1&size=10&sort=priceAsc

### 정렬 조건 생략 - 최신순 기본 적용
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=10

### 잘못된 정렬 조건
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=0&size=10&sort=abc

### 잘못된 페이지 번호
GET http://localhost:8080/products/page?page=-1&size=10

### 남성 상품 + 가격 오름차순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=MEN&sort=priceAsc&page=0&pageSize=10


### 여성 상품 + 가격 내림차순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=WOMEN&sort=priceDesc&page=0&pageSize=10


### 여성 + 상의 + 검정색
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=WOMEN&category=TOP&color=BLACK&sort=priceAsc&page=0&pageSize=10


### M 사이즈 + 가격 내림차순
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?size=M&sort=priceDesc&page=0&pageSize=10


### 남성 + 상의 + 검정색 + M 사이즈
GET http://localhost:8080/products/filter?gender=MEN&category=TOP&color=BLACK&size=M&sort=priceAsc&page=0&pageSize=10